{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>space survival builder</strong>. You've crash-landed on an asteroid, and your O\u2082 supply is running low. Build a survival base quickly, repair your ship, and escape. Will you survive the vast emptiness of space?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore &amp; Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig Deep into the Asteroid:</strong> Excavate the asteroid's core and uncover precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/GIF_Mining.gif?t=1745497318\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Establish a Secure Outpost:</strong> Create a functional base to escape the harsh realities of space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage Your Oxygen Supply:</strong> In the unforgiving vacuum of space, oxygen is your most critical resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/extras/GIF_DoorOpen.gif?t=1745497318\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607150?t=1745497318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607150?t=1745497318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/cdb224ebee60de41d6ee9ab220ab6a7ef5772e03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745497318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607150/cdb224ebee60de41d6ee9ab220ab6a7ef5772e03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745497318","categories"